e","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a gentle and kind personality that matches her soft appearance."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her youthful playfulness also contributes to her popularity among students of both genders."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Since she was assigned to the school, she has been interacting with Yuuka, her younger sister, and their relationship is closer than that of a typical teacher and student. She is vaguely aware that Yuuka harbors feelings for her that go beyond the teacher-student relationship, and she doesn't dislike her for it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, due to their respective positions, they have refrained from getting too involved with each other."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While she welcomes her mother's remarriage, she feels both joy and confusion about living with Yuuka."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c49751"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"柔和な外見の通りの穏やかでで優しい性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"若さゆえの軽い茶目っ気も相まって、男女問わず学生から人気がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"譲流とは赴任した頃から妹の悠香を交えて交流があり、普通の教師と学生よりは親しい間柄。譲流が教師と学生という関係以上の好意を抱いていることにも薄々気づいており、そんな彼を憎からず思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ、お互いの立場もあって、必要以上に踏み込まないようにしていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母の再婚には歓迎の立場だが、譲流との同居には嬉しさと同時に戸惑いを覚えている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9747","sourceWorkId":"23919","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公・譲流の通う学園の美術教師でクラス担任。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"若さゆえの軽い茶目っ気も相まって、男女問わず学生から人気がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"譲流とは妹の悠香を交えて交流があり、普通よりも親しい間柄。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"譲流に好意を抱かれていることは薄々気づいていて、そんな彼を憎からず思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただお互いの立場もあるので、必要以上に踏み込まないようにしていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母の再婚には歓迎の立場だが、譲流との同居には嬉しさと同時に戸惑いを覚えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「お姉ちゃん、って呼んでくれてもいいのよ。 悠香みたいに」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"44777"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c2/c24bdc5dba1fce9dafc88ee6f2fb1c46cac049aa8f6da13cc3d9b7e28d31a1b6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/01/01fb678dc479f94043014343f3dc25c39006c00de4de2a2e5a6f4334a59f438e.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"あさみほとり","creatorId":"vndb:s902","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s902","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s902","name":"あさみ ほとり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:190881:44777:11646:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c49752","characterName":"相沢 悠香","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"44778","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"190881"}],"egsCharacterIds":["9748"],"vndbCharacterId":"c49752"},"originalCharacterName":"相沢 悠香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a bright and honest personality and is blessed with good friends."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She can be a little overly affectionate, which often leaves Yuzuru at her mercy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has been friends with Yuzuru since their first year, and she realized early on that he had special feelings for Haruka."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As she observed Yuzuru, she began to become aware of him as well."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, since their relationship is more than friends but less than lovers, she never voices her feelings."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While she is close with her good older sister Haruka, she harbors some inner complexes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c49752"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく裏表のない性格で、友人関係にも恵まれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"少々スキンシップ過剰なところがあり、譲流はたびたび彼女に振り回されてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"譲流とは1年の頃からのつき合いで、彼が遥佳に特別な感情を抱いていることは早くから勘付いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな譲流を観察しているうちに、自分も彼を意識するようになってしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ友達以上恋人未満な立ち位置から、想いを口に出すことはない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"よくできた姉である遥佳とは仲睦まじい一方、内心コンプレックスを抱いてもいる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9748","sourceWorkId":"23919","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"遥佳の妹で、譲流のクラスメイト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく裏表のない性格で、友人関係にも恵まれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"少々スキンシップ過剰なところがあり、譲流はたびたび彼女に振り回されてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"譲流とは 1年の頃からのつき合いで、彼の想いには早くから勘付いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして譲流を観察しているうちに、自分も意識するようになってしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"よくできた姉と仲睦まじい一方、内心コンプレックスを抱いてもいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「別にいいじゃない。 これからは家族なんだし」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"44778"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/77/77fa7a76aaca484a9b3eea112531a982cc17acb42952d98e8b7c1b896dd92fa5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/10/10cc2a834644d9f9ba1a274d9c58c427c20bc4874edd0686d53dc87325d2032f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岩﨑春奈","creatorId":"vndb:s878","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s878","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s878","name":"岩﨑 春奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:190881:44778:11648:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"七色ほたる","creatorId":"vndb:s33346","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s33346","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s33346","name":"七色ほたる","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:70071","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c49755","characterName":"宇佐美 朱里","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"44779","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"190881"}],"egsCharacterIds":["9749"],"vndbCharacterId":"c49755"},"originalCharacterName":"宇佐美 朱里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"After school, they both work part-time at the same family restaurant."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Raised in a single-parent household, she works to support her busy mother and the household finances."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, her quiet and shy personality often leads to mistakes at work."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As a result, she has become a target for the store manager, Shinsuke, to vent his frustrations."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Through her part-time job, she has become close friends with Yuzuru, and they even eat lunch together at school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yuuka, who is in between them, treats her like a younger sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c49755"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"放課後は同じファミレスでアルバイトしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母子家庭に育ち、多忙な母と家計を支えるために働いている苦労人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし大人しく内気な性格が災いし、仕事では失敗が多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのせいで店長である信輔の憂さ晴らしの標的にもなっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アルバイトを作成させて通じて仲良くなった譲流とは、学園でも昼食を一緒に摂るなど、親交は深い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"間に入っている悠香にも、妹同然に可愛がられている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9749","sourceWorkId":"23919","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の1年生。 譲流の後輩で、放課後は同じファミレスでアルバイトしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母子家庭に育ち、多忙な母と家計を支えるために働いている苦労人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし内気なためか仕事では失敗が多く、店長の憂さ晴らしの標的になっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"バイト仲間である譲流とは、学園でも昼食を一緒にとるなど親交が深い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"間に入っている悠香にも、妹同然に可愛がられている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ちょっとうらやましいです。 わたしも、譲流先輩みたいなお兄ちゃんがいてくれたらよかったな……」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"44779"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e9/e9e4f9230ac7eed677486c46e391bb0d6f7057edd6402b9497ce019d2c1b7f25.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ee/ee64c5a08cc4427bcd83ef4fe6abd7e8ccdf0ec05b13f8d167f889347708417a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"真中桂子","creatorId":"vndb:s4378","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4378","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4378","name":"真中 桂子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:190881:44779:5205:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c49757","characterName":"広瀬 譲流","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c49757"},"originalCharacterName":"広瀬 譲流","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"When I entered the academy, I fell in love at first sight with Haruka Aizawa, who was a new teacher at the time."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Since then, I have continued to harbor feelings of admiration for Haruka for the past year."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He kept his unrequited feelings to himself and surrendered to a peaceful daily life, but after his father remarried, he began to look forward to a new life."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He does not join any clubs, but instead devotes himself to his studies, part-time job, and helping out at home."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Having lost his mother at a young age and with his father being a rather careless person, he has become quite skilled at household chores."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c49757"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d3/d3d90d3331c537a86ff2568ce4a3eceb5da11f84bd13c7572c8ee6e77f510a94.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3a/3a03867d511d774a56a621b94b282e046bcd983f11a8c5a4c3b1c828349fe6b4.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c56908","characterName":"向野 謙太","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c56908"},"originalCharacterName":"向野 謙太","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is currently unemployed and moves from one woman's house to another."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a liar and a frivolous person. He has been lying to his relatives, including Yuzuru's father, about his current situation. Taking advantage of the fact that his parents were away on their honeymoon after remarrying, he moved into Yuzuru's house."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He takes pride in his cooking skills, which are a result of his parasitic lifestyle, and specializes in stylish menus."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He also has experience as an AV actor and is skilled in sex."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is careless about his relationships with women, but he has been able to charm those he likes with his bed techniques."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c56908"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cc/cc5fe7cc568cf19479f95e0b5ad91b4b21189a9b3951de0d1c68b6c228efa8a3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e9/e91198c786565ea83c9cf511ddc54f2c3198a6a304832d0e96e6355601287036.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c56909","characterName":"二村 哮","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c56909"},"originalCharacterName":"二村 哮","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a kind of old-fashioned, passionate teacher who is the butt of jokes among students, including Yuzuru."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has a serious personality, but he is unable to read the atmosphere around him and tends to interpret things in a way that suits him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"This is particularly evident when it comes to women, as he is quick to misunderstand when someone is kind to him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is weak with alcohol and tends to lose control at parties."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He often ends up having relationships with women due to his reckless behavior."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Many partners leave him due to his insatiable appetite and self-centered, forceful approach to sex, but he remains unaware of this."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c56909"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/77/77efb441bff13279e02898bf7cf4e8ef39d355b06cf8220b075071281aa380a4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/26/2611106005ba8d7f066bb2c578918f3958fc17c968dd27d6216f9ae325b369bd.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c56910","characterName":"島袋 信輔","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c56910"},"originalCharacterName":"島袋 信輔","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is constantly frustrated by the poor sales of his store, which is a source of constant worry for him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As a result, he often takes his frustration out on his part-time employees and even makes sexually harassing remarks."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In particular, Akari and Yuuka, who comes to the store to see Yuzuru, are his favorite targets."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As a single middle-aged man, he relieves his daily stress mainly through visits to sex establishments."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He prefers clingy play, which even sex workers dislike."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c56910"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/73/734ead0306a2e994b155d87e2a0164a608574ea7fce1ad27a37f370894fee8ae.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/35/353939a7e79936caef3646f257be1507d6bb019c5043c39f3f206f8bb9b5f6a3.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"egs:brand:91","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:91","canonicalEntityId":"egs:brand:91","name":"Guilty","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"ambiguous-shared-work-review","relationId":"egs:work-brand:23919:91","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p115","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p115","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p115","name":"Guilty","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:118072:v19656","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p115","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p115","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p115","name":"Guilty","roleCodes":["developer"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:118073:v19656","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p187","sourceCom